Package: elyra-pardus
Version: @DEBIAN_VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Elyra Team
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-venv, python3-pip, python3-tk, python3-pil.imagetk, python3-bpfcc, bpfcc-tools, clang, libmagic1, linux-headers-amd64, systemd
Description: Elyra Pardus entropy-based autonomous defence engine
 Elyra combines explainable static analysis, fanotify pre-execution
 monitoring, BCC/eBPF runtime telemetry, protected IPC, quarantine and
 tamper-evident auditing. The installed service defaults to monitor-only mode
 and automatic destructive responses are disabled.
